  "scientificRationale": "The complete fresh Unity Williams-block process is the independent experimental unit. A per-sample retained delta can include first-load, JIT, and cache effects as well as leakage. The former 128 MiB value therefore remains a visible diagnostic alert, while a 256 MiB per-sample emergency stop and the unchanged complete-block/native hard gates prevent uncontrolled growth and cross-sample contamination.",
